WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:03,350
Oh my gosh, things are changing so fast.

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,750
Before the Doomsday, it was said that it would take 30 to 50 years for an uninhabited city to be covered by nature.

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:09,950
At this rate, the building will be covered with vines in a year's time

4
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:15,790
Loss has also evolved and can now trot.

5
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:20,400
Be careful, you may also be attacked by surprise.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,300
Try my current knife and regain the demon

7
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,100
Can you chop the lost bones with one knife?

8
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:33,660
I will also try a new trick today

9
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,180
Take a look at the jade sword that goes with the memorial ceremony

10
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,860
Ten plus ten equals twenty

11
00:00:36,860 --> 00:00:38,780
Or ten percent equals one hundred

12
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:46,650
I'll go to the left, you and Xu Jing go to the right

13
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:48,650
You kill Xu Jing and restore your physical strength to your BUFF.

14
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:49,650
Pay attention to cooperation

15
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,650
Good. Guaranteed to complete the task.
